@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### List stamps
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/stamps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add stamp (repeat to check idempotence)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/stamps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phrase_id": "q1"}

### Unknown phrase: 404 unknown_phrase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/me/stamps
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"phrase_id": "q99"}
